{"hymn":"S215","parent":"E267","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"Con Tu Espíritu de gracia","subtitle":"La plenitud del Espíritu—El llenar","syl":{"n1":"Con","n2":["Tu‿Es","i"],"n3":["pí","m"],"n4":["ri","m"],"n5":["tu","t"],"n6":"de","n7":["gra","i"],"n8":["cia,","t"],"n9":["Lle","i"],"n10":["na","t"],"n11":"mi","n12":["es","i"],"n13":["pí","m"],"n14":["ri","m"],"n15":["tu;","t"],"n16":"Y","n17":"con","n18":"Tu","n19":["pre","i"],"n20":["sen","m"],"n21":["cia","t"],"n22":["san","i"],"n23":["ta,","t"],"n24":"¡Ven,","n25":["Se","i"],"n26":["ñor,","t"],"n27":["llé","i"],"n28":["na","m"],"n29":["me,","t"],"n30":"Tú!","n31":["¡Llé","i"],"n32":["na","m"],"n33":["me!","t"],"n34":["¡Llé","i"],"n35":["na","m"],"n36":["me!","t"],"n37":["¡Llé","i"],"n38":["ne","m"],"n39":["me","t"],"n40":["Tu‿Es","i"],"n41":["pí","m"],"n42":["ri","m"],"n43":["tu!","t"],"n44":"Me","n45":["des","i"],"n46":["po","m"],"n47":["je,","t"],"n48":"me","n49":["va","i"],"n50":["cí","m"],"n51":["e,","t"],"n52":["¡Llé","i"],"n53":["ne","m"],"n54":["me","t"],"n55":["Tu‿Es","i"],"n56":["pí","m"],"n57":["ri","m"],"n58":["tu!","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Que Tu‿Espíritu me llene,","Como sea, no lo sé;","Mas te necesito tanto;","¡Ven, Señor, y lléname!"]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Lleno de debilidades,","Vengo a Tus pies, Señor;","Con Tu‿Espíritu eterno,","¡Lléname con Tu vigor!"]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Lava, salva y bendice;","¡Llena mi espíritu!","Consolando y salvando,","Dulcemente llenas Tú."]}]}